[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784811131","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104289#issuecomment-2784811131","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104289","id":2784811131,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l_Nh7","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T22:56:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T22:56:56Z","body":"> - [ ] Investigate having the option enable with detection instead when using alpha clipping\r\n\r\nNote that there is no strict 1:1 mapping between textures and materials. It's technically possible for the same texture to be used in different materials, some of which use alpha scissor and others using alpha blending.\r\n\r\nThat said, it's reasonable to assume that if you're using an albedo texture in a material with alpha scissor, other usages of the same texture will also use alpha scissor (or maybe opaque – in which case the alpha channel is unimportant). It's unlikely you'll be using alpha blended transparency with the same texture.\r\n\r\nIn a future PR, it should be feasible to modify the glTF and FBX importers to do this on extracted textures. If the same texture is used in multiple materials, then it should enable this option as soon as one material that references the texture in its albedo property uses alpha scissor. The target would be set to the average alpha scissor value used across all materials that use the texture.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784811131/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4653833452","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104289#issuecomment-4653833452","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104289","id":4653833452,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFWPc7A","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T21:46:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T21:47:35Z","body":"@Arnklit Can you look into rebasing this to fix merge conflicts? I t